<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 39,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 39,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual receipts 39,000 and Saturday's 26,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were steady with midsession Friday. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				  Country		    Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		   52.50 -53.50	   53.50 -54.50</p>
<p>few			     52.00  54.00	   53.00  55.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $2.00. Top $47.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.	 42.00 -43.00	   43.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		  42.00 -44.00	   43.00 -44.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		   45.00 -47.00	   45.00 -47.00</p>
